      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Antisense correction of SMN2 splicing converted a lethal inherited disease into one with an effective mechanism-based therapy and established a broader therapeutic principle.",
        "attribution": "Krainer's splicing biology and Bennett's antisense-drug development form a concise, complementary credit allocation.",
        "maturity": "The biological mechanism, clinical efficacy, and durable clinical implementation are well established.",
        "uncertainties": [
