      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "cGAS-STING supplied a major mechanism by which cytosolic DNA initiates innate immune signaling, reshaping research on infection, autoimmunity, and cancer.",
        "attribution": "Chen, Barber, and Ishikawa represent key contributions to the pathway's discovery and functional definition, though the record is distributed.",
        "maturity": "The core pathway is robustly established and biologically influential.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Therapeutic translation remains uneven.",
          "Priority and credit are more complex than for several higher-ranked candidates."
        ]
      }
